menu "SempreIoT SAFR (siot_safr)"

    config SIOT_SAFR_DEDUP_CAP
        int "Dedupe table entries (SRC_MAC, MSG_ID)"
        default 16
        range 4 64
        help
            Recent (SRC_MAC, MSG_ID) pairs kept for SIOT_SAFR_DEDUP_TTL_MS so a
            fast retransmission (same MSG_ID, fresh MSG_CTR - spec 9.1) is
            processed once and ACKed every time. 16 was the POC value
            (pocs/node/main/node_mesh.c DEDUP_CAP).

    config SIOT_SAFR_DEDUP_TTL_MS
        int "Dedupe window (ms)"
        default 30000
        help
            Spec 9.1: "within a 30 s window".

    config SIOT_SAFR_PEERS_MAX
        int "Replay table entries (one per SRC_MAC)"
        default 32
        range 4 128
        help
            Last (BOOT_CTR, MSG_CTR) kept per SRC_MAC for the replay check of
            spec 4. The board sees every device on site (blueprint target 50
            units => set higher there); a node sees the board and the central.
            Least-recently-heard entry is evicted when full.

    config SIOT_SAFR_HANDLERS_MAX
        int "Dispatcher slots (one per MSG_TYPE)"
        default 16
        range 4 64
        help
            Phase 1 registers at most 10 (MSG_TYPE 0x01..0x0A); features add
            new types (features/README.md).

endmenu
